In our study, we first summarize each participant’s expected treatment benefit with EWTR on two ordered time-to-event endpoints. Next, we utilize the composite moderator M* derived from the weighted sum of single baseline moderators via Kraemer’s method [13] to develop the PTR strategy, or the individual-level decision rule. We regress the EWTR outcome on a model with treatment (Z), composite moderator, and the interaction term between treatment and the composite moderator. These parameters are used to compute PTR:5\documentclass[12pt]{minimal}
