We performed a 5-fold cross validation analysis; for each training set, we estimated the weights for the four effect moderators using Kraemer’s approach and using the testing set, created a composite moderator M*. Thus, across all folds, we obtain a M* value for each participant. After fitting the following linear model:18\documentclass[12pt]{minimal}
